  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9535522460938,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Four studies reported on the impact of IGRAs on TB therapy. In two studies, IGRA results",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9974365234375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "were reported to clinicians; one study did not discuss the consequences, and in the other",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9642333984375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "study QFT-positive children and adolescents received preventive chemotherapy. The other",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.00830078125,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "two studies commented on the reduced number of patients that would require preventive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.16119384765625,
        352.6877746582031,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "therapy if IGRAs were part of the diagnostic algorithm.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        146.66119384765625,
        444.5466003417969,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "The following aspects related to the feasibility of IGRAs were highlighted:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.9888305664062,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "blood amounts required may be an issue; however, tests were performed with less than",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983838081359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        162.19419860839844,
        93.1460952758789,
        176.2191925048828
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        294.48248291015625,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "2 mL of blood (T-Spot) in some studies;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        193.16119384765625,
        526.70654296875,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "a strong interferon response in negative control tubes (high background results) in QFT",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.994598388671875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        193.19419860839844,
        93.1460952758789,
        207.2191925048828
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        208.66119384765625,
        367.4106750488281,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "may reflect the influence of other coincident diseases;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        224.16119384765625,
        526.771240234375,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "standardization and generation of automated, quantitative results should render IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977877616882324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        224.19419860839844,
        93.1460952758789,
        238.2191925048828
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        239.66119384765625,
        265.43408203125,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "more objective than the TST; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        255.16119384765625,
        526.9920043945312,
        268.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "a well-equipped laboratory, expensive equipment and training are required for IGRA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        255.19419860839844,
        93.36609649658203,
        268.41619873046875
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "MyriadPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        270.66119384765625,
        374.0440979003906,
        283.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "test performance, which may cause logistical problems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.1728210449219,
        191.30810546875,
        312.55279541015625
      ],
      "text": "Research priorities",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.8037109375,
        526.9811401367188,
        335.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "Targeted further research to identify IGRAs with improved accuracy is strongly encouraged.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.3037109375,
        526.968994140625,
        351.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "Such research should be based on adequate study design, including quality principles such as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.8037109375,
        526.9552612304688,
        366.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "representative suspect populations, prospective follow-up, and adequate and explicit blinding.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972265243530273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.3037109375,
        526.6939697265625,
        382.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "It is also strongly recommended that proof-of-principle studies be followed by evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.8037109375,
        526.9478759765625,
        397.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "produced from prospectively implemented and well-designed evaluation and demonstration",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.3037109375,
        304.4258117675781,
        413.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "studies, including assessment of patient impact.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.9599304199219,
        204.6109161376953,
        452.1899108886719
      ],
